# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
py_env/
.venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TechUpSkills course-repo conventions
# Slide decks, QA/report docs, and scratch dirs are not student-facing artifacts
# and stay out of the course repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# PowerPoint decks (large binaries, distributed separately)
*.pptx
*.pptm
*.potx
*.ppt

# QA / test-report markdown, any case (qa-report.md, LAB-QA.md, anticipated-qa.md)
*[qQ][aA]*.md

# Internal reports and notes (ALL-CAPS .md) are not student-facing.
# Allow-list instead of [A-Z]*.md (case-insensitive filesystems).
*.md
!README.md
!README-Codespace.md
!LICENSE.md
!labs.md
!.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Scratch / staging subdirectories
_*/
